{"S": [{"i": 0, "t0": 0.0, "t1": 0.406, "text": "Qish.", "p": 0}, {"i": 1, "t0": 0.765, "t1": 2.111, "text": "Tashqarida minus o'n besh.", "p": 0}, {"i": 2, "t0": 2.322, "t1": 4.425, "text": "Soat kechasi o'n bir-u qirq yetti.", "p": 0}, {"i": 3, "t0": 5.312, "t1": 7.514, "text": "Sen choy ichib, telefonda video ko'rib o'tiribsan.", "p": 0}, {"i": 4, "t0": 7.863, "t1": 9.096, "text": "Va birdan — chiq.", "p": 0}, {"i": 5, "t0": 9.374, "t1": 10.088, "text": "Svet o'chdi.", "p": 0}, {"i": 6, "t0": 10.676, "t1": 11.695, "text": "Hech gap emas, deysan.", "p": 1}, {"i": 7, "t0": 12.06, "t1": 13.072, "text": "Bir-ikki soatda keladi.", "p": 1}, {"i": 8, "t0": 13.412, "t1": 14.471, "text": "Har qish shunaqa-ku.", "p": 1}, {"i": 9, "t0": 14.813, "t1": 16.432, "text": "Lekin bu safar svet kelmaydi.", "p": 2}, {"i": 10, "t0": 16.849, "t1": 17.48, "text": "Ertaga ham.", "p": 2}, {"i": 11, "t0": 18.034, "t1": 18.719, "text": "Indinga ham.", "p": 2}, {"i": 12, "t0": 19.165, "t1": 21.691, "text": "Butun O'zbekistonda — yetti kun svet yo'q.", "p": 2}, {"i": 13, "t0": 22.304, "t1": 27.701, "text": "Bugun kunma-kun ko'ramiz: uyingga, shahringga, tanangga va odamlarga nima bo'ladi.", "p": 3}, {"i": 14, "t0": 28.075, "t1": 31.826, "text": "Oxirida esa — hayotingni saqlab qolishi mumkin bo'lgan besh qoida.", "p": 3}, {"i": 15, "t0": 32.317, "t1": 35.558, "text": "Oxirigacha ko'r, bu bilim bir kun kerak bo'lishi mumkin.", "p": 3}, {"i": 16, "t0": 36.439, "t1": 37.0, "text": "Birinchi kun.", "p": 4}, {"i": 17, "t0": 37.252, "t1": 37.986, "text": "Birinchi soat.", "p": 4}, {"i": 18, "t0": 38.204, "t1": 41.978, "text": "Hamma bir xil ish qiladi: telefon fonarini yoqadi va sham qidiradi.", "p": 4}, {"i": 19, "t0": 42.306, "t1": 43.183, "text": "Sham topilmaydi.", "p": 4}, {"i": 20, "t0": 43.594, "t1": 44.674, "text": "Hech qachon topilmaydi.", "p": 4}, {"i": 21, "t0": 45.049, "t1": 46.851, "text": "Telefonda zaryad — qirq foiz.", "p": 5}, {"i": 22, "t0": 47.245, "t1": 48.17, "text": "Internet hali bor.", "p": 5}, {"i": 23, "t0": 48.589, "t1": 51.121, "text": "Hamma guruhlarga yozadi: «Sizlarda ham o'chdimi?»", "p": 5}, {"i": 24, "t0": 51.589, "t1": 52.36, "text": "— «Ha, bizda ham».", "p": 5}, {"i": 25, "t0": 52.698, "t1": 55.709, "text": "Lekin ikki-uch soatdan keyin internet ham yo'qoladi.", "p": 6}, {"i": 26, "t0": 56.162, "t1": 60.878, "text": "Chunki aloqa minoralarida ham akkumulyator bor — u bir necha soatga yetadi, xolos.", "p": 6}, {"i": 27, "t0": 61.171, "t1": 62.487, "text": "Keyin — «Tarmoq yo'q».", "p": 6}, {"i": 28, "t0": 63.022, "t1": 64.537, "text": "Endi sen dunyodan uzilding.", "p": 6}, {"i": 29, "t0": 65.124, "t1": 66.433, "text": "Endi eng qiziq joyi.", "p": 7}, {"i": 30, "t0": 66.834, "t1": 69.603, "text": "Ko'pchilik o'ylaydi: «Gaz bor-ku, issiq bo'ladi».", "p": 7}, {"i": 31, "t0": 70.049, "t1": 70.332, "text": "Yo'q.", "p": 7}, {"i": 32, "t0": 70.695, "t1": 75.641, "text": "Zamonaviy kotellar elektrsiz ishlamaydi — nasos ham, avtomatika ham tokda.", "p": 7}, {"i": 33, "t0": 76.064, "t1": 77.997, "text": "Gaz bor, lekin isitish yo'q.", "p": 7}, {"i": 34, "t0": 78.504, "t1": 83.279, "text": "Ko'p qavatli uylarda yana bir muammo: suvni yuqori qavatlarga nasoslar chiqaradi.", "p": 8}, {"i": 35, "t0": 83.688, "t1": 86.762, "text": "Nasos to'xtadi — beshinchi qavatdan yuqorida suv yo'q.", "p": 8}, {"i": 36, "t0": 87.137, "t1": 88.133, "text": "Lift ham to'xtagan.", "p": 8}, {"i": 37, "t0": 88.583, "t1": 90.592, "text": "Kimdir hozir liftda qolib ketdi.", "p": 8}, {"i": 38, "t0": 91.413, "t1": 92.037, "text": "Ikkinchi kun.", "p": 9}, {"i": 39, "t0": 92.269, "t1": 94.997, "text": "Ertalab uyg'onasan — uyda o'n bir daraja issiq.", "p": 9}, {"i": 40, "t0": 95.238, "t1": 96.568, "text": "Og'zingdan bug' chiqyapti.", "p": 9}, {"i": 41, "t0": 97.011, "t1": 99.26, "text": "Uy har soatda bir-ikki daraja soviyapti.", "p": 9}, {"i": 42, "t0": 100.231, "t1": 103.505, "text": "Va aynan shu yerda odamlar eng xavfli xatoga yo'l qo'yadi.", "p": 10}, {"i": 43, "t0": 103.826, "t1": 106.367, "text": "Gaz plitani yoqib, oshxona eshigini yopishadi.", "p": 11}, {"i": 44, "t0": 106.669, "t1": 107.453, "text": "«Isinib olamiz».", "p": 11}, {"i": 45, "t0": 107.851, "t1": 109.741, "text": "Yoki ko'mir manqalni uyga olib kirishadi.", "p": 11}, {"i": 46, "t0": 110.018, "t1": 110.81, "text": "Bu — is gazi.", "p": 12}, {"i": 47, "t0": 111.24, "t1": 113.002, "text": "Uning rangi ham, hidi ham yo'q.", "p": 12}, {"i": 48, "t0": 113.402, "t1": 114.435, "text": "Sen uni sezmaysan.", "p": 12}, {"i": 49, "t0": 114.944, "t1": 117.313, "text": "Avval boshing og'riydi, keyin uyqu bosadi…", "p": 12}, {"i": 50, "t0": 117.593, "t1": 118.859, "text": "va sen uxlab qolasan.", "p": 12}, {"i": 51, "t0": 119.306, "t1": 120.029, "text": "Uyg'onmaysan.", "p": 12}, {"i": 52, "t0": 120.277, "t1": 121.417, "text": "Bu ertak emas.", "p": 13}, {"i": 53, "t0": 121.899, "t1": 124.796, "text": "O'zbekistonda har qish is gazidan odamlar halok bo'ladi.", "p": 13}, {"i": 54, "t0": 125.039, "t1": 127.021, "text": "Ko'pincha — butun oila bilan, uyquda.", "p": 13}, {"i": 55, "t0": 127.36, "t1": 130.935, "text": "Birinchi qoida: gaz plita va manqal bilan uy isitilmaydi.", "p": 14}, {"i": 56, "t0": 131.331, "t1": 136.46, "text": "Agar baribir olov yoqsang — fortochka ochiq bo'lsin, va hech qachon olov yonib turganda uxlama.", "p": 14}, {"i": 57, "t0": 136.84, "t1": 137.819, "text": "Ko'chaga chiqasan.", "p": 15}, {"i": 58, "t0": 138.109, "t1": 138.958, "text": "Shahar boshqacha.", "p": 15}, {"i": 59, "t0": 139.299, "t1": 141.752, "text": "Svetoforlar o'chiq — chorrahalarda tiqilinch.", "p": 15}, {"i": 60, "t0": 142.148, "t1": 146.03, "text": "Benzin quyish shoxobchalari ham ishlamaydi — chunki nasoslar tokda ishlaydi.", "p": 15}, {"i": 61, "t0": 146.324, "t1": 148.654, "text": "Do'konga kirasan — terminal ishlamaydi.", "p": 16}, {"i": 62, "t0": 149.076, "t1": 150.143, "text": "Bankomat ishlamaydi.", "p": 16}, {"i": 63, "t0": 150.491, "t1": 153.426, "text": "Kartangda pul bor, lekin u endi hech narsa emas.", "p": 16}, {"i": 64, "t0": 153.6, "t1": 154.651, "text": "Faqat naqd pul.", "p": 16}, {"i": 65, "t0": 154.861, "t1": 157.835, "text": "Kimning cho'ntagida naqd pul bo'lsa — o'sha xarid qiladi.", "p": 16}, {"i": 66, "t0": 158.218, "t1": 161.824, "text": "Bir kunda do'konlarda sham, batareyka, suv va non tugaydi.", "p": 17}, {"i": 67, "t0": 162.164, "t1": 162.936, "text": "Uchinchi kun.", "p": 18}, {"i": 68, "t0": 163.337, "t1": 165.508, "text": "Uy endi tashqaridan unchalik farq qilmaydi.", "p": 18}, {"i": 69, "t0": 165.884, "t1": 167.812, "text": "Quvurlardagi suv muzlay boshlaydi.", "p": 18}, {"i": 70, "t0": 168.22, "t1": 170.633, "text": "Muz kengayadi — va quvurlar yoriladi.", "p": 18}, {"i": 71, "t0": 170.983, "t1": 172.237, "text": "Ichimlik suvi tugayapti.", "p": 19}, {"i": 72, "t0": 172.396, "t1": 173.736, "text": "Lekin tashqarida qor bor.", "p": 19}, {"i": 73, "t0": 174.2, "t1": 177.742, "text": "Qorni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri yeyish mumkin emas — tanangni ichidan sovutadi.", "p": 19}, {"i": 74, "t0": 178.054, "t1": 181.119, "text": "Uni idishga solib eritasan, imkon bo'lsa qaynatasan.", "p": 19}, {"i": 75, "t0": 181.993, "t1": 183.516, "text": "Muzlatgich ham ishlamayapti.", "p": 20}, {"i": 76, "t0": 183.671, "t1": 187.84, "text": "Lekin qishning bitta afzalligi bor: balkon — tabiatning bepul muzlatgichi.", "p": 20}, {"i": 77, "t0": 188.079, "t1": 189.442, "text": "Go'shtni balkonga chiqarasan.", "p": 20}, {"i": 78, "t0": 189.72, "t1": 191.458, "text": "Qish — ham dushman, ham do'st.", "p": 20}, {"i": 79, "t0": 191.636, "t1": 193.476, "text": "To'rtinchi kuni qiziq narsa ro'y beradi.", "p": 21}, {"i": 80, "t0": 193.797, "t1": 194.903, "text": "Odamlar ko'chaga chiqadi.", "p": 21}, {"i": 81, "t0": 195.21, "t1": 197.133, "text": "Qo'shnilar bir-biri bilan gaplasha boshlaydi.", "p": 21}, {"i": 82, "t0": 197.404, "t1": 199.661, "text": "Va bobolarimizning usullari yana tiriladi.", "p": 22}, {"i": 83, "t0": 199.941, "t1": 200.493, "text": "Sandal.", "p": 22}, {"i": 84, "t0": 200.671, "t1": 201.088, "text": "Tandir.", "p": 22}, {"i": 85, "t0": 201.396, "t1": 202.244, "text": "O'choqda qozon.", "p": 22}, {"i": 86, "t0": 202.536, "t1": 205.388, "text": "Hovlida o'tin yoqib, butun mahalla bitta osh damlaydi.", "p": 22}, {"i": 87, "t0": 205.589, "t1": 207.675, "text": "Sandal atrofida butun oila o'tiradi.", "p": 23}, {"i": 88, "t0": 207.964, "t1": 209.59, "text": "Telefon yo'q, televizor yo'q.", "p": 23}, {"i": 89, "t0": 209.889, "t1": 211.421, "text": "Bobo yoshligini gapirib beradi.", "p": 23}, {"i": 90, "t0": 211.719, "t1": 214.348, "text": "Ko'pchilik shunda birinchi marta haqiqatan gaplashadi.", "p": 23}, {"i": 91, "t0": 214.594, "t1": 217.001, "text": "Lekin bitta yangi xavf bor — mish-mishlar.", "p": 24}, {"i": 92, "t0": 217.324, "t1": 218.979, "text": "Internet yo'q, yangilik yo'q.", "p": 24}, {"i": 93, "t0": 219.29, "t1": 220.294, "text": "«Bir oy kelmas ekan».", "p": 24}, {"i": 94, "t0": 220.551, "t1": 221.816, "text": "«Hamma joyda shunaqa emish».", "p": 24}, {"i": 95, "t0": 222.154, "t1": 224.027, "text": "Qo'rquv sovuqdan ham tez tarqaladi.", "p": 24}, {"i": 96, "t0": 224.287, "t1": 226.782, "text": "Shuning uchun batareykali radio — oltinga teng.", "p": 25}, {"i": 97, "t0": 227.069, "t1": 229.283, "text": "Rasmiy xabarni faqat o'shandan eshitasan.", "p": 25}, {"i": 98, "t0": 229.67, "t1": 231.181, "text": "Beshinchi kun — eng og'ir.", "p": 26}, {"i": 99, "t0": 231.521, "t1": 234.29, "text": "Endi ko'zga ko'rinmas xavf: uy ichida sovqotish.", "p": 26}, {"i": 100, "t0": 234.626, "t1": 237.759, "text": "Tananing harorati o'ttiz beshdan pastga tushsa — bu gipotermiya.", "p": 27}, {"i": 101, "t0": 238.086, "t1": 239.046, "text": "Avval qaltiraysan.", "p": 27}, {"i": 102, "t0": 239.334, "t1": 241.101, "text": "Qaltirash — tananing ichki pechkasi.", "p": 27}, {"i": 103, "t0": 241.443, "t1": 245.266, "text": "Lekin qaltirash to'xtasa va hamon sovuq bo'lsa — bu yomon belgi.", "p": 27}, {"i": 104, "t0": 245.624, "t1": 248.105, "text": "Uyqu bosadi, hech narsa qiziq bo'lmay qoladi.", "p": 27}, {"i": 105, "t0": 248.402, "t1": 251.47, "text": "Eng xavf ostidagilar — keksalar va yosh bolalar.", "p": 28}, {"i": 106, "t0": 251.799, "t1": 253.24, "text": "Ular sovuqni kech sezadi.", "p": 28}, {"i": 107, "t0": 253.588, "t1": 256.308, "text": "Ikkinchi qoida: qo'shningdagi keksalardan xabar ol.", "p": 29}, {"i": 108, "t0": 256.592, "t1": 259.925, "text": "Bir termos issiq choy kimningdir hayotini saqlab qolishi mumkin.", "p": 29}, {"i": 109, "t0": 260.382, "t1": 263.05, "text": "Uchinchi qoida: butun oila bitta xonaga yig'iling.", "p": 30}, {"i": 110, "t0": 263.366, "t1": 265.078, "text": "Eng kichik xona — eng issiq.", "p": 30}, {"i": 111, "t0": 265.449, "t1": 268.527, "text": "Derazalarga ko'rpa iling, eshik tagini latta bilan to'sing.", "p": 30}, {"i": 112, "t0": 268.813, "t1": 272.212, "text": "Bosh kiyim kiying — issiqlikning katta qismi boshdan chiqib ketadi.", "p": 30}, {"i": 113, "t0": 273.108, "t1": 276.41, "text": "Yettinchi kuni ertalab.", "p": 31}, {"i": 114, "t0": 276.76, "t1": 278.328, "text": "Qayerdandir quvonchli qichqiriq eshitiladi.", "p": 31}, {"i": 115, "t0": 278.699, "t1": 279.456, "text": "Derazalar birin-ketin yorishadi.", "p": 31}, {"i": 116, "t0": 279.718, "t1": 280.453, "text": "Svet keldi!", "p": 31}, {"i": 117, "t0": 280.746, "t1": 282.647, "text": "Lekin shoshma.", "p": 32}, {"i": 118, "t0": 283.145, "t1": 285.38, "text": "Eng xavfli lahza aynan hozir.", "p": 32}, {"i": 119, "t0": 285.731, "t1": 288.951, "text": "Butun shahar bir vaqtda hamma narsani yoqadi: isitgichlar, kotellar, choynaklar.", "p": 32}, {"i": 120, "t0": 289.204, "t1": 291.499, "text": "Tarmoq ko'tarolmaydi — svet yana o'chadi, texnikang kuyadi.", "p": 32}, {"i": 121, "t0": 292.131, "t1": 296.315, "text": "To'rtinchi qoida: svet o'chganda hamma texnikani rozetkadan sug'urib qo'y.", "p": 33}, {"i": 122, "t0": 296.666, "t1": 299.353, "text": "Kelganda — ularni birin-ketin, sekin yoq.", "p": 33}, {"i": 123, "t0": 299.814, "t1": 302.552, "text": "Xullas, yetti kun svetsiz qanday omon qolish kerak.", "p": 34}, {"i": 124, "t0": 303.008, "t1": 303.441, "text": "Birinchi.", "p": 35}, {"i": 125, "t0": 303.732, "t1": 307.256, "text": "Gaz plita va manqal bilan isitma — is gazi jimgina o'ldiradi.", "p": 35}, {"i": 126, "t0": 307.781, "t1": 308.218, "text": "Ikkinchi.", "p": 36}, {"i": 127, "t0": 308.476, "t1": 309.89, "text": "Keksa qo'shnilardan xabar ol.", "p": 36}, {"i": 128, "t0": 310.328, "t1": 310.757, "text": "Uchinchi.", "p": 37}, {"i": 129, "t0": 311.011, "t1": 314.1, "text": "Hammangiz bitta kichik xonaga yig'iling va issiq kiyining.", "p": 37}, {"i": 130, "t0": 314.505, "t1": 315.026, "text": "To'rtinchi.", "p": 38}, {"i": 131, "t0": 315.318, "t1": 318.056, "text": "Texnikani o'chirib qo'y, svet kelganda sekin yoq.", "p": 38}, {"i": 132, "t0": 318.464, "t1": 318.966, "text": "Beshinchi.", "p": 39}, {"i": 133, "t0": 319.231, "t1": 325.204, "text": "Uyda doim zaxira bo'lsin: fonar, batareykalar, powerbank, naqd pul, suv va batareykali radio.", "p": 39}, {"i": 134, "t0": 325.538, "t1": 328.596, "text": "Bularning hammasi bitta oylik internet pulidan arzon.", "p": 40}, {"i": 135, "t0": 328.954, "t1": 332.025, "text": "Lekin bir kun kelib, aynan shular oilangni asraydi.", "p": 40}, {"i": 136, "t0": 332.491, "t1": 336.369, "text": "Endi izohlarda yozing: sizda eng uzoq svet necha soat o'chgan?", "p": 41}, {"i": 137, "t0": 336.635, "t1": 338.269, "text": "Va o'sha paytda nima qilgansiz?", "p": 41}, {"i": 138, "t0": 338.608, "t1": 341.252, "text": "Eng qiziq hikoyalarni keyingi videoda o'qiyman.", "p": 41}, {"i": 139, "t0": 341.695, "t1": 345.406, "text": "Videoni bir yaqiningga yubor — bu bilim unga ham kerak bo'lishi mumkin.", "p": 42}, {"i": 140, "t0": 345.735, "t1": 347.196, "text": "Layk bos, obuna bo'l.", "p": 43}, {"i": 141, "t0": 347.55, "t1": 348.94, "text": "Keyingi videoda ko'rishguncha.", "p": 43}, {"i": 142, "t0": 349.309, "t1": 350.051, "text": "Issiq kiyining!", "p": 43}], "provisional": false}